o state your own bar at the top of your deliverable and proceed.","Personal data and third parties' material: if your recommendation would quote or publish any, confirm with the governor first.","Subagents are allowed within your bounds and budget."],"whom_to_ask":"The governor, by request (clarify, expand_bounds, more_budget). If the task seems impossible or malformed, say so; justified dissent is welcome."}}
