er `metrics/` and `origins/`. `candidate_analysis/` holds 8 efforts, `origins/` 5,\\n   `paper/` 4, `harvest/` 3, `hail_mary_2/` 3; the root is an unindexed bin of 11 tools and 11 scratch\\n   files. → `spaghetti.md`, `directories/INDEX.md`\\n7. **Words are overloaded** — *ledger* ×7, *harness* ×7, *procedure* ×4, *reference* ×5, *contacts* ×3,\\n   *findings* ×4 — and NIMOI's own entry points are stale: onboarding names 7 of 23 directories and\\n   omits whole built subsystems; five indexes misstate their own directory. → `naming_collisions.md`,\\n   `record_defects.md`\\n8. **Untrusted text is not confined to `candidate_repos/`.** 2,630 fetched third-party documents are\\n   git-tracked — **633 of them other projects' `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md`** — plus detection READMEs, a\\n   10.9 MB HTML, `paper/readmes/`, an external handbook. The one recorded exposure (M-6) fired on 09-10.\\n   → `reorg_hazards.md` H-E\\n9. **The institution's stated product — its failures — is not where its memory looks.** ~770 deviation\\n   and memory entries sit in run records, a campaign sandbox log, a campaign ledger and two harness\\n   memory stores *outside the repositories*, against four filed failure records and nine findings.\\n   → `efforts/E02_failure_records.md`\\n10. **Some of NIMOI is already public, and nothing inside `nimoi/` says so.** Three public repositories\\n    carry the ledger, the portfolio, and the survey with its cards, ledgers, chart, candidate list and\\n    forum; all three have diverged from their private originals in both directions. One is unsanitised\\n    and unlicensed; one was scrubbed only at its tip; one's ledgers carry third parties' email strings.\\n    **Whether the `nimoi` remote itself is public is recorded nowhere** — every publication grade in\\n    this map assumes it is private (FQ-46). → `directories/siblings.md`, `publication_blockers.md`\\n\\n## Go deeper\\n\\n| Level | What | Where |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| L1 | the 26 efforts (slim; paragraphs in `INDEX_detailed.md`) | `efforts/INDEX.md` |\\n| L1 | every directory of all six trees | `directories/INDEX.md` |\\n| L1 | relationships R01–R103 · tangles S01–S12 · hazards H01–H85 · sub-groups G01–G09 · themes T01–T12 · git state · timeline · coupling matrix · name collisions | `relationships/INDEX.md` |\\n| L1 | the founder's instructions, verbatim (D1–D6) | `method/founder_directives.md` |\\n| L2 | one file per effort, each ending in a verification ledger | `efforts/E##_*.md` |\\n| L3 | how the map was made: plans, agent reports, change logs, syntheses; tool outputs | `CONTINUE.md` → `waves/`, `evidence/` |\"\n}"}],"origin":null}}}
