nd-volume page | **done** | `waves/wave_03/` (`orientation`, `plan`, `returns`, `merge_directive`, `carveout_changelog`, `integration_changelog`, `synthesis`, `reports/`) |\\n| 04 | — | **not planned.** See \\\"What would be worth doing next\\\" | — |\\n\\n**Instruments at the end of Wave 03** (outputs in `evidence/`): integrity — `nimoi/`,\\n`nimoi-autosurvey/`, `emi-survey/`, `nlt-ledger/`, `nimoi_samples/`, `applications/` — **all 0 added /\\n0 removed / 0 changed** since their baselines; `git status` of `nimoi` identical to session start\\n(222 entries); map ↔ disk path check 3,034 of 3,364 cited paths resolve, the rest explained.\\n\\n**Identifiers taken:** E01–E26 · G01–G09 · R01–R103 · S01–S12 · H01–H85 (sections H-A…H-F) · T01–T12 ·\\nFQ-01–FQ-52 · `rd-D01`–`rd-D122` (the defects register's own series) · Q01–Q05 (all closed — superseded\\nby the FQ series) · X1–X5 (settled) · U1–U3 (ruled) · F01–F12 (W02 refutations) · M1–M14 (merge\\nrulings) · B01–B35 (borrowed ideas) · D1–D6 (founder directives).\\n**Next free: E27 · G10 · R104 · S13 · H86 · T13 · FQ-53 · B36 · D7.**\\n\\n## What the founder has been told, and what they have not yet answered\\n\\nTold in the wave-end reports: what is already public (three repositories; email strings in the survey\\nledgers; the unsanitised, unlicensed portfolio; the tip-only scrub); autosurvey 54 commits unpushed;\\n`applications/` and this map exist in one copy; the line-endings hazard; the orchestrator's memory-note\\nwrite outside this directory. **Unanswered — all 52 of `FOUNDER_QUESTIONS.md`; the six that gate most:**\\nFQ-46 (are the `nimoi` / autosurvey remotes private?) · FQ-17 (push autosurvey) · FQ-19 (what untracked\\nwork is committed) · FQ-27 / FQ-47 (what is already public) · FQ-01 (is the measurement loop over) ·\\nFQ-25 (who owns the shared libraries).\\n\\n## What would be worth doing next (none started; choose *after* the founder answers)\\n\\n1. **Fold in the founder's answers**: state calls change `eff