{"ts":"2026-09-29T17:19:36.974Z","author":"harness:claude-anthropic-harness/task-7-project","name":"log/20260929T171602Z/000265","body":{"kind":"message","agent":"owner.1","turn":1,"direction":"to_agent","message":{"_type":"UserMessage","content":[{"_type":"ToolResultBlock","tool_use_id":"toolu_01JxzfuvtHw814Bf91VuTx7X","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n \"path\": \"/nimoi_mapping_project/efforts/INDEX.md\",\n \"start_line\": 1,\n \"end_line\": 131,\n \"total_lines\": 131,\n \"next_offset\": null,\n \"line_truncated\": false,\n \"sha256\": \"15ac5347168f5f60c116161007720fb13bc686944d80846393d19f36600115cc\",\n \"text\": \"# Efforts — index\\n\\n*Level 1 of the map. Reached from `../MAP.md`. **Last updated: 2026-09-20, Wave 03 integration — slimmed\\nto one line per effort** (`../waves/wave_03/integration_changelog.md`). **The full-paragraph version,\\nwith every \\\"also in\\\" list, every *(W02: ✗ …)* / *(W03: ✗ …)* refutation note and every per-row source,\\nis preserved verbatim in [`INDEX_detailed.md`](INDEX_detailed.md)** (frozen 2026-09-20). Earlier change\\nlogs: `../waves/wave_03/carveout_changelog.md`, `../waves/wave_02/integration_changelog.md`.*\\n\\n## How to read this page\\n\\n- **26 efforts, in nine sub-groups.** An *effort* is a sustained line of work with its own goal; IDs\\n  are stable (`../method/conventions.md` §4), names may be revised. **E25** and **E26** were carved out\\n  of E11 and E21 in Wave 03; both parents kept their IDs with a narrowed scope.\\n- **`G##` is the level between the two spines and the efforts** — spine → sub-group → effort — asked\\n  for by founder directive D4.3 and allocated in `../waves/wave_03/merge_directive.md` §2. A sub-group\\n  is a *logical* unit; which repository would hold its bytes is a separate question. **Everything about\\n  the sub-groups — why each is one, how each could become a gitignored subproject, what crosses its\\n  boundary — is in `../relationships/subprojects.md`**; this page only carries the membership.\\n- **State** uses seven words: *active* (touched in the last week of the record, 09-10 → 09-16) ·\\n  *stalled* (mid-flight, a named next step never taken) · *dormant* (stopped without a closing\\n  statement) · *parked* (stopped cleanly, resumable by design) · *completed* · *superseded* ·\\n  *shelved* (built, then switched off). The record ends 09-16; nothing was written 09-16 → 09-19.\\n- **Primary home** is one path. Most efforts are smeared over several directories — the matrix is\\n  `../relationships/spaghetti.md` §1; the by-directory view is `../directories/INDEX.md`.\\n- **Export potential** is the grade from `../relationships/publication_blockers.md` §2, not re-derived\\n  here: **AS-IS** publishable as it stands · **MECH** after mechanical scrubbing · **EDIT** after\\n  editorial review · **NO** not publishable as it stands. Every *working* tree is private; \\\"public\\\"\\n  has always meant a separate export repository. \\\"**already public**\\\" marks material that is in one of\\n  the three public sibling repositories today (`../directories/siblings.md`). **All grades assume the\\n  `nimoi` GitHub remote is private — which is recorded nowhere** (`reorg_hazards.md` H70).\\n- **Each effort file** (`E##_*.md`) has the same ten sections: what it is · where it lives · how it\\n  works · timeline · state and unfinished business · relationships · **re-org notes (§7 — what must move\\n  together, what must not be deleted, what is re-fetchable, hard-wired paths, misfiled material,\\n  natural seams)** · record-integrity defects · open questions · verification ledger. For a re-org,\\n  read §2, §5 and §7 first.\\n- **The Wave 01 groups A–F** map onto the sub-groups as: A → G01 + G02 + G03 (E07, E08) · B → G04 ·\\n  C → G06 + E25 (G03) · D → G07 + G08 (E15, E18–E20) · E → G09 + E26 (G08) · F → G05.\\n\\n## G01 · Charter & memory *(institutional spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E01** | Constitution, onboarding & virtue register | G01 | doctrine frozen 08-26; `virtues.md` still written to, 55% uncommitted | 08-10 → 09-16 | `origins/` | EDIT · onboarding 1.08 is already public (inside `nimoi_samples`) | `E01_constitution_onboarding_virtues.md` |\\n| **E02** | Failure records | G01 | dormant in both conventions; live practice sits in four other registers | 08-12 → 09-10 | `origins/*_001_*.md` | MECH | `E02_failure_records.md` |\\n| **E03** | General-findings corpus | G01 | dormant since 08-21; 9 files, one deleted, recoverable from git | 08-13 → 08-21 | `general_findings/` | AS-IS | `E03_general_findings.md` |\\n\\n## G02 · Method engineering *(institutional spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E04** | Procedure library & its governance | G02 | stalled at deployment stage 1; generator would fail today | 08-10 → 08-28 | `procedures/` | AS-IS | `E04_procedure_library_governance.md` |\\n| **E05** | External-technical-assimilation (ETA) process | G02 | completed v1.0 (08-25); never exercised since | 08-13 → 08-25 | `processes/` | AS-IS · six versions already public (inside `nimoi_samples`) | `E05_eta_process.md` |\\n| **E06** | Procedure-acquisition campaign | G02 | completed through stage 1; 16 liens + 16 opportunities open | 08-13 → 08-24 | `campaigns/procedure_acquisition/` | MECH † | `E06_procedure_acquisition_campaign.md` |\\n\\n## G03 · Platform — ledger, harness, and the design thinking about both *(institutional spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E07** | NLT ledger (ELDEST lineage + server) | G03 | shelved: built 08-22, ran once, switched off 08-29 | 08-10 → 08-23 (config 08-29) | `nlt_ledger/` (+ `ELDEST/` ×4) | EDIT · already public, sanitised at the tip only: `nlt-ledger` | `E07_nlt_ledger.md` |\\n| **E08** | Next-generation design | G03 | dormant since 09-10; entirely untracked (9 files) | 09-04 → 09-10 | `nimoi_design/`, `harness-design/`, `standards/` | AS-IS | `E08_nextgen_design.md` |\\n| **E25** | Three-loop harness and its ports *(carved out of E11)* | G03 | dormant as software since 08-29; alive as a written standard | 08-28 → 09-01 | `hail_mary_2/{harness/, …}` (+ two ports inside `nimoi-autosurvey/`) | MECH † | `E25_three_loop_harness.md` |\\n\\n## G04 · Story *(institutional spine — load)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E09** | ai-2026 scenario & the governed-revision method it produced | G04 | dormant since 08-17; clean v4.1 close-out, unfinished v5 restart | 08-09 → 08-17 (+1 file 09-04) | `story/` | EDIT | `E09_story_ai2026.md` |\\n\\n## G05 · Personal — job search & portfolio *(institutional spine — load)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E24** | Job search & the \\\"Auditable Multi-Agent Engineering\\\" portfolio | G05 | `job/` dormant since 08-23; continued in `applications/` to 08-24 | 08-13 → 08-24 | `job/` (+ sibling `local_26/applications/` — no git, no backup) | NO — never public · its portfolio is already public, unsanitised and unlicensed: `nimoi_samples` | `E24_job_search_portfolio.md` |\\n\\n## G06 · Field survey — finding others like NIMOI *(field spine)*\\n\\n*One survey effort in five instalments, spanning both repositories (S01).*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E10** | Stabilization-papers harvest & corpus summarization | G06 | parked; watermark kept for a third window; 100% committed | 08-13 → 08-21 | `harvest/stabilization_loop/` | EDIT | `E10_papers_harvest.md` |\\n| **E11** | Institution scan → ARPI scan (the detector line) | G06 | stopped incomplete 08-29; four tickets open, final report never written | 08-25 → 08-29 | `harvest/institution_scan/` → `hail_mary_2/arpi_scan/` | NO (MECH once its fetched stores are split out) | `E11_institution_arpi_scan_hm2_harness.md` |\\n| **E12** | Survey-craft packaging | G06 | completed in one day; a declared mirror, 73 of 75 identical | 08-30 | `legacy_survey_material/` | MECH | `E12_legacy_survey_package.md` |\\n| **E13** | `nimoi-autosurvey` (sibling repository) | G06 | dormant since 09-02; 54 commits unpushed; synthesis stage never built | 08-30 → 09-02 | `local_26/nimoi-autosurvey/` | EDIT | `E13_nimoi_autosurvey.md` |\\n| **E14** | Field detection & ranking (the 09-02 run, imported back) | G06 *(housed in `candidate_analysis/`)* | completed; shortlist file modified, uncommitted; entirely tracked otherwise | 09-02 → 09-03 | `candidate_analysis/{detected-projects-09-02, detection_reports}/` | NO (MECH without the fetched corpus) · its shortlist is already public (`emi-survey`) | `E14_field_detection_0902.md` |\\n\\n## G07 · Corpus first reads *(field spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E16** | Gold harvest | G07 | completed; self-requested verification never done (M-7) | 08-26 → 08-27 | `harvest/candidate_gold/` | MECH | `E16_gold_harvest.md` |\\n| **E17** | Step-1 / Step-2 survey & deep analysis | G07 | superseded by E19 from 08-31; seven self-flagged partials | 08-27 → 08-30 | `candidate_analysis/{reports, data, special}/` | EDIT | `E17_step_survey_deep_analysis.md` |\\n\\n## G08 · EMI study — corpus, definition, instrument, comparison, charts *(field spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E15** | Candidate corpus & early reads | G08 *(its store stays a parent-level quarantine)* | active as a queue: 23 of 61 clones unscanned; no manifest | 08-25 → 09-13 | `candidate_repos/` (**untrusted — not mapped**; see `../directories/candidate_repos.md`) | NO | `E15_candidate_corpus.md` |\\n| **E18** | Paradigm theory (RDI → ARPI → EMI) | G08 | migrated 09-02; v5 still the live definition | 08-27 → 09-02 | `candidate_analysis/theory/` | AS-IS | `E18_paradigm_theory.md` |\\n| **E19** | EMI index & measurement suites | G08 | active but stalled: loop stopped 09-13; 47% untracked | 08-31 → 09-16 | `candidate_analysis/metrics/` | EDIT · 16 cards, 20 ledgers and the rubric are already public (`emi-survey`) | `E19_emi_index_measurement_suites.md` |\\n| **E20** | Feature comparison study | G08 | completed 09-09; frozen at 17 cards; untracked | 09-09 | `candidate_analysis/comparisons/` | MECH | `E20_feature_comparison_study.md` |\\n| **E26** | EMI chart & export toolchain *(carved out of E21)* | G08 *(housed in `paper/`)* | last code that ran (09-16); newest builders untracked | 09-02 → 09-16 | `paper/{charts, scripts}/` | MECH · its 09-03 chart is already public (Figure 1 of `emi-survey`) | `E26_emi_chart_export_toolchain.md` |\\n\\n## G09 · Paper & outreach *(field spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E21** | EMI survey paper | G09 | drafts dormant since 09-08; v5/v6 unreconciled; v2/v3 line published | 09-02 → 09-16 | `paper/{brainstorming, drafts, reviews, stories, attachments, readmes}/` | EDIT · the post is already public (`emi-survey`; ≈ `convergent_v3`, not v4) | `E21_emi_paper_charts.md` |\\n| **E22** | Outreach & peer contact | G09 | dormant since 09-06; three replies recorded, sending never recorded | 08-28 → 09-06 | `paper/{contacts, ai_contacts}/` | NO · its venue charter is already public (the Discussions form) | `E22_outreach_peer_contact.md` |\\n| **E23** | AI-organizations literature study | G09 | completed 09-16 and quarantined; proposals unacted-on | 09-14 → 09-16 | `paper/organizations/` | EDIT | `E23_ai_organizations_study.md` |\\n\\n**Tally.** AS-IS 5 (E03, E04, E05, E08, E18) · MECH 7 (E02, E06, E12, E16, E20, E25, E26) · EDIT 9 · NO 5\\n(E11, E14, E15, E22 — other people's material; E24 — the founder's own).\\n**†** `publication_blockers.md` §2 carries a Wave 03 note that this row under-lists quoted (E06) or\\nvendored (E25) third-party text; the grade may move to EDIT — an editorial call.\\n\\\"Spine\\\" is a label, not a boundary: the two spines are a chronology and a regime change after ≈ 08-30,\\nnot a partition of efforts (`../relationships/effort_graph.md`, picture paragraph and R103).\\n\\n## Not efforts\\n\\n| Material | What it is | Belongs with |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 10 root `.txt` files (`cited_paths`, `full_read`, `grep_touched`, `not_reached`, `reached_*`, `verify_out`, `ver_headers`, `pr_subjects*`) | Suite 4.x scratch — ✔ W02 (`w02_emi_measurement`): 7 files = working files of the **`governance-a` producer of the `jarvis` run** (its `scope.json` counts 122 / 69 / 53 match exactly); `ver_headers.txt` = the `galadriel-public` run `20260903-0221`; `pr_subjects*.txt` = the `hermes-v2` run `20260913-0053`, one list in two delimiters | E19 |\\n| root `gamess_extract.txt` | hand extraction of one `pdf_only` harvest paper | E10 |\\n| 11 root `.py` tools | the institution's de-facto tool bin — see `../relationships/root_tools.md`; every `.py` in the estate is censused in `../relationships/tools_census.md` | E04 ×4, shared utilities ×2, E06 ×2, E09 ×1, E10 ×1, E17 ×1 |\\n| `.claude/` | a dev-server entry (→E14), an MCP toggle (→E07 — W02: the off switch, held by git nowhere: H42), a runtime lock (W02: →E19 — `scheduled_tasks.lock` timestamps the scanning loop's first fire) | — |\\n| *(W02)* the harness memory store, `~/.claude/projects/C--Users-pjhud-local-26-nimoi/memory/` — outside both repositories | 8 files + index, 08-22 → 09-16: a shadow failure/findings register (R43), keyed by the project's absolute path *(W03: **9 files + index** now — the ninth, `nimoi-mapping-project.md`, and a rewritten index are dated 09-19 19:59 and were written by **this mapping effort's own orchestrator session**, not by NIMOI work; `nimoi-autosurvey` has a separate store of 7 entries — H39, H72 — `w03_audit_attack` O4, `w03_subprojects_a`)* | E02 / E03 in kind, E19 in content (7 of 8) — whether it is part of NIMOI is a founder question (H39, H49; FQ-38) |\\n| *(W03)* the four sibling directories `local_26/{emi-survey, nlt-ledger, nimoi_samples, applications}` | three public repositories extracted from E07, E24 / E05 and E19 / E21 / E22 / E14 / E26, and one private, git-less continuation of E24 — `../directories/siblings.md` | not efforts: *publication subprojects* and an *adopted sibling* in `../relationships/subprojects.md`'s terms |\\n| `ignore/commands.txt` | three desktop launcher shortcuts | founder convenience |\\n| `.summarize/` | `summarize_corpus.py` configuration | E10 |\\n| `__pycache__/` (root and scattered) | bytecode | none |\"\n}"}],"is_error":null}],"uuid":"f4c0c248-6cd4-43fd-b201-a76bb9b6b9f7","parent_tool_use_id":null,"tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n \"path\": \"/nimoi_mapping_project/efforts/INDEX.md\",\n \"start_line\": 1,\n \"end_line\": 131,\n \"total_lines\": 131,\n \"next_offset\": null,\n \"line_truncated\": false,\n \"sha256\": \"15ac5347168f5f60c116161007720fb13bc686944d80846393d19f36600115cc\",\n \"text\": \"# Efforts — index\\n\\n*Level 1 of the map. Reached from `../MAP.md`. **Last updated: 2026-09-20, Wave 03 integration — slimmed\\nto one line per effort** (`../waves/wave_03/integration_changelog.md`). **The full-paragraph version,\\nwith every \\\"also in\\\" list, every *(W02: ✗ …)* / *(W03: ✗ …)* refutation note and every per-row source,\\nis preserved verbatim in [`INDEX_detailed.md`](INDEX_detailed.md)** (frozen 2026-09-20). Earlier change\\nlogs: `../waves/wave_03/carveout_changelog.md`, `../waves/wave_02/integration_changelog.md`.*\\n\\n## How to read this page\\n\\n- **26 efforts, in nine sub-groups.** An *effort* is a sustained line of work with its own goal; IDs\\n  are stable (`../method/conventions.md` §4), names may be revised. **E25** and **E26** were carved out\\n  of E11 and E21 in Wave 03; both parents kept their IDs with a narrowed scope.\\n- **`G##` is the level between the two spines and the efforts** — spine → sub-group → effort — asked\\n  for by founder directive D4.3 and allocated in `../waves/wave_03/merge_directive.md` §2. A sub-group\\n  is a *logical* unit; which repository would hold its bytes is a separate question. **Everything about\\n  the sub-groups — why each is one, how each could become a gitignored subproject, what crosses its\\n  boundary — is in `../relationships/subprojects.md`**; this page only carries the membership.\\n- **State** uses seven words: *active* (touched in the last week of the record, 09-10 → 09-16) ·\\n  *stalled* (mid-flight, a named next step never taken) · *dormant* (stopped without a closing\\n  statement) · *parked* (stopped cleanly, resumable by design) · *completed* · *superseded* ·\\n  *shelved* (built, then switched off). The record ends 09-16; nothing was written 09-16 → 09-19.\\n- **Primary home** is one path. Most efforts are smeared over several directories — the matrix is\\n  `../relationships/spaghetti.md` §1; the by-directory view is `../directories/INDEX.md`.\\n- **Export potential** is the grade from `../relationships/publication_blockers.md` §2, not re-derived\\n  here: **AS-IS** publishable as it stands · **MECH** after mechanical scrubbing · **EDIT** after\\n  editorial review · **NO** not publishable as it stands. Every *working* tree is private; \\\"public\\\"\\n  has always meant a separate export repository. \\\"**already public**\\\" marks material that is in one of\\n  the three public sibling repositories today (`../directories/siblings.md`). **All grades assume the\\n  `nimoi` GitHub remote is private — which is recorded nowhere** (`reorg_hazards.md` H70).\\n- **Each effort file** (`E##_*.md`) has the same ten sections: what it is · where it lives · how it\\n  works · timeline · state and unfinished business · relationships · **re-org notes (§7 — what must move\\n  together, what must not be deleted, what is re-fetchable, hard-wired paths, misfiled material,\\n  natural seams)** · record-integrity defects · open questions · verification ledger. For a re-org,\\n  read §2, §5 and §7 first.\\n- **The Wave 01 groups A–F** map onto the sub-groups as: A → G01 + G02 + G03 (E07, E08) · B → G04 ·\\n  C → G06 + E25 (G03) · D → G07 + G08 (E15, E18–E20) · E → G09 + E26 (G08) · F → G05.\\n\\n## G01 · Charter & memory *(institutional spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E01** | Constitution, onboarding & virtue register | G01 | doctrine frozen 08-26; `virtues.md` still written to, 55% uncommitted | 08-10 → 09-16 | `origins/` | EDIT · onboarding 1.08 is already public (inside `nimoi_samples`) | `E01_constitution_onboarding_virtues.md` |\\n| **E02** | Failure records | G01 | dormant in both conventions; live practice sits in four other registers | 08-12 → 09-10 | `origins/*_001_*.md` | MECH | `E02_failure_records.md` |\\n| **E03** | General-findings corpus | G01 | dormant since 08-21; 9 files, one deleted, recoverable from git | 08-13 → 08-21 | `general_findings/` | AS-IS | `E03_general_findings.md` |\\n\\n## G02 · Method engineering *(institutional spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E04** | Procedure library & its governance | G02 | stalled at deployment stage 1; generator would fail today | 08-10 → 08-28 | `procedures/` | AS-IS | `E04_procedure_library_governance.md` |\\n| **E05** | External-technical-assimilation (ETA) process | G02 | completed v1.0 (08-25); never exercised since | 08-13 → 08-25 | `processes/` | AS-IS · six versions already public (inside `nimoi_samples`) | `E05_eta_process.md` |\\n| **E06** | Procedure-acquisition campaign | G02 | completed through stage 1; 16 liens + 16 opportunities open | 08-13 → 08-24 | `campaigns/procedure_acquisition/` | MECH † | `E06_procedure_acquisition_campaign.md` |\\n\\n## G03 · Platform — ledger, harness, and the design thinking about both *(institutional spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E07** | NLT ledger (ELDEST lineage + server) | G03 | shelved: built 08-22, ran once, switched off 08-29 | 08-10 → 08-23 (config 08-29) | `nlt_ledger/` (+ `ELDEST/` ×4) | EDIT · already public, sanitised at the tip only: `nlt-ledger` | `E07_nlt_ledger.md` |\\n| **E08** | Next-generation design | G03 | dormant since 09-10; entirely untracked (9 files) | 09-04 → 09-10 | `nimoi_design/`, `harness-design/`, `standards/` | AS-IS | `E08_nextgen_design.md` |\\n| **E25** | Three-loop harness and its ports *(carved out of E11)* | G03 | dormant as software since 08-29; alive as a written standard | 08-28 → 09-01 | `hail_mary_2/{harness/, …}` (+ two ports inside `nimoi-autosurvey/`) | MECH † | `E25_three_loop_harness.md` |\\n\\n## G04 · Story *(institutional spine — load)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E09** | ai-2026 scenario & the governed-revision method it produced | G04 | dormant since 08-17; clean v4.1 close-out, unfinished v5 restart | 08-09 → 08-17 (+1 file 09-04) | `story/` | EDIT | `E09_story_ai2026.md` |\\n\\n## G05 · Personal — job search & portfolio *(institutional spine — load)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E24** | Job search & the \\\"Auditable Multi-Agent Engineering\\\" portfolio | G05 | `job/` dormant since 08-23; continued in `applications/` to 08-24 | 08-13 → 08-24 | `job/` (+ sibling `local_26/applications/` — no git, no backup) | NO — never public · its portfolio is already public, unsanitised and unlicensed: `nimoi_samples` | `E24_job_search_portfolio.md` |\\n\\n## G06 · Field survey — finding others like NIMOI *(field spine)*\\n\\n*One survey effort in five instalments, spanning both repositories (S01).*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E10** | Stabilization-papers harvest & corpus summarization | G06 | parked; watermark kept for a third window; 100% committed | 08-13 → 08-21 | `harvest/stabilization_loop/` | EDIT | `E10_papers_harvest.md` |\\n| **E11** | Institution scan → ARPI scan (the detector line) | G06 | stopped incomplete 08-29; four tickets open, final report never written | 08-25 → 08-29 | `harvest/institution_scan/` → `hail_mary_2/arpi_scan/` | NO (MECH once its fetched stores are split out) | `E11_institution_arpi_scan_hm2_harness.md` |\\n| **E12** | Survey-craft packaging | G06 | completed in one day; a declared mirror, 73 of 75 identical | 08-30 | `legacy_survey_material/` | MECH | `E12_legacy_survey_package.md` |\\n| **E13** | `nimoi-autosurvey` (sibling repository) | G06 | dormant since 09-02; 54 commits unpushed; synthesis stage never built | 08-30 → 09-02 | `local_26/nimoi-autosurvey/` | EDIT | `E13_nimoi_autosurvey.md` |\\n| **E14** | Field detection & ranking (the 09-02 run, imported back) | G06 *(housed in `candidate_analysis/`)* | completed; shortlist file modified, uncommitted; entirely tracked otherwise | 09-02 → 09-03 | `candidate_analysis/{detected-projects-09-02, detection_reports}/` | NO (MECH without the fetched corpus) · its shortlist is already public (`emi-survey`) | `E14_field_detection_0902.md` |\\n\\n## G07 · Corpus first reads *(field spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E16** | Gold harvest | G07 | completed; self-requested verification never done (M-7) | 08-26 → 08-27 | `harvest/candidate_gold/` | MECH | `E16_gold_harvest.md` |\\n| **E17** | Step-1 / Step-2 survey & deep analysis | G07 | superseded by E19 from 08-31; seven self-flagged partials | 08-27 → 08-30 | `candidate_analysis/{reports, data, special}/` | EDIT | `E17_step_survey_deep_analysis.md` |\\n\\n## G08 · EMI study — corpus, definition, instrument, comparison, charts *(field spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E15** | Candidate corpus & early reads | G08 *(its store stays a parent-level quarantine)* | active as a queue: 23 of 61 clones unscanned; no manifest | 08-25 → 09-13 | `candidate_repos/` (**untrusted — not mapped**; see `../directories/candidate_repos.md`) | NO | `E15_candidate_corpus.md` |\\n| **E18** | Paradigm theory (RDI → ARPI → EMI) | G08 | migrated 09-02; v5 still the live definition | 08-27 → 09-02 | `candidate_analysis/theory/` | AS-IS | `E18_paradigm_theory.md` |\\n| **E19** | EMI index & measurement suites | G08 | active but stalled: loop stopped 09-13; 47% untracked | 08-31 → 09-16 | `candidate_analysis/metrics/` | EDIT · 16 cards, 20 ledgers and the rubric are already public (`emi-survey`) | `E19_emi_index_measurement_suites.md` |\\n| **E20** | Feature comparison study | G08 | completed 09-09; frozen at 17 cards; untracked | 09-09 | `candidate_analysis/comparisons/` | MECH | `E20_feature_comparison_study.md` |\\n| **E26** | EMI chart & export toolchain *(carved out of E21)* | G08 *(housed in `paper/`)* | last code that ran (09-16); newest builders untracked | 09-02 → 09-16 | `paper/{charts, scripts}/` | MECH · its 09-03 chart is already public (Figure 1 of `emi-survey`) | `E26_emi_chart_export_toolchain.md` |\\n\\n## G09 · Paper & outreach *(field spine)*\\n\\n| ID | Effort | G | State | Dates | Primary home | Export potential | File |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **E21** | EMI survey paper | G09 | drafts dormant since 09-08; v5/v6 unreconciled; v2/v3 line published | 09-02 → 09-16 | `paper/{brainstorming, drafts, reviews, stories, attachments, readmes}/` | EDIT · the post is already public (`emi-survey`; ≈ `convergent_v3`, not v4) | `E21_emi_paper_charts.md` |\\n| **E22** | Outreach & peer contact | G09 | dormant since 09-06; three replies recorded, sending never recorded | 08-28 → 09-06 | `paper/{contacts, ai_contacts}/` | NO · its venue charter is already public (the Discussions form) | `E22_outreach_peer_contact.md` |\\n| **E23** | AI-organizations literature study | G09 | completed 09-16 and quarantined; proposals unacted-on | 09-14 → 09-16 | `paper/organizations/` | EDIT | `E23_ai_organizations_study.md` |\\n\\n**Tally.** AS-IS 5 (E03, E04, E05, E08, E18) · MECH 7 (E02, E06, E12, E16, E20, E25, E26) · EDIT 9 · NO 5\\n(E11, E14, E15, E22 — other people's material; E24 — the founder's own).\\n**†** `publication_blockers.md` §2 carries a Wave 03 note that this row under-lists quoted (E06) or\\nvendored (E25) third-party text; the grade may move to EDIT — an editorial call.\\n\\\"Spine\\\" is a label, not a boundary: the two spines are a chronology and a regime change after ≈ 08-30,\\nnot a partition of efforts (`../relationships/effort_graph.md`, picture paragraph and R103).\\n\\n## Not efforts\\n\\n| Material | What it is | Belongs with |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 10 root `.txt` files (`cited_paths`, `full_read`, `grep_touched`, `not_reached`, `reached_*`, `verify_out`, `ver_headers`, `pr_subjects*`) | Suite 4.x scratch — ✔ W02 (`w02_emi_measurement`): 7 files = working files of the **`governance-a` producer of the `jarvis` run** (its `scope.json` counts 122 / 69 / 53 match exactly); `ver_headers.txt` = the `galadriel-public` run `20260903-0221`; `pr_subjects*.txt` = the `hermes-v2` run `20260913-0053`, one list in two delimiters | E19 |\\n| root `gamess_extract.txt` | hand extraction of one `pdf_only` harvest paper | E10 |\\n| 11 root `.py` tools | the institution's de-facto tool bin — see `../relationships/root_tools.md`; every `.py` in the estate is censused in `../relationships/tools_census.md` | E04 ×4, shared utilities ×2, E06 ×2, E09 ×1, E10 ×1, E17 ×1 |\\n| `.claude/` | a dev-server entry (→E14), an MCP toggle (→E07 — W02: the off switch, held by git nowhere: H42), a runtime lock (W02: →E19 — `scheduled_tasks.lock` timestamps the scanning loop's first fire) | — |\\n| *(W02)* the harness memory store, `~/.claude/projects/C--Users-pjhud-local-26-nimoi/memory/` — outside both repositories | 8 files + index, 08-22 → 09-16: a shadow failure/findings register (R43), keyed by the project's absolute path *(W03: **9 files + index** now — the ninth, `nimoi-mapping-project.md`, and a rewritten index are dated 09-19 19:59 and were written by **this mapping effort's own orchestrator session**, not by NIMOI work; `nimoi-autosurvey` has a separate store of 7 entries — H39, H72 — `w03_audit_attack` O4, `w03_subprojects_a`)* | E02 / E03 in kind, E19 in content (7 of 8) — whether it is part of NIMOI is a founder question (H39, H49; FQ-38) |\\n| *(W03)* the four sibling directories `local_26/{emi-survey, nlt-ledger, nimoi_samples, applications}` | three public repositories extracted from E07, E24 / E05 and E19 / E21 / E22 / E14 / E26, and one private, git-less continuation of E24 — `../directories/siblings.md` | not efforts: *publication subprojects* and an *adopted sibling* in `../relationships/subprojects.md`'s terms |\\n| `ignore/commands.txt` | three desktop launcher shortcuts | founder convenience |\\n| `.summarize/` | `summarize_corpus.py` configuration | E10 |\\n| `__pycache__/` (root and scattered) | bytecode | none |\"\n}"}],"origin":null}}}
