de an adopted repository onboarded into NIMOI, or does it keep its own entry contract?**\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"path\": \"/nimoi_mapping_project/FOUNDER_QUESTIONS.md\",\n   \"line\": 248,\n   \"text\": \"**FQ-52 · May `candidate_analysis/contacts/` (tables about named third parties) be moved out before `candidate_analysis/` gets its first commit as its own repository?**\"\n  }\n ],\n \"files_searched\": 1,\n \"files_walked\": 1,\n \"pruned\": [],\n \"truncated\": false\n}"}],"origin":null}}}
